    "caveats": [
      "A549 is an alveolar epithelial line with modest barrier function; for a true alveolar-capillary barrier consider a primary alveolar epithelial (ATII) cell or a co-culture with lung microvascular endothelium.",
      "Verify the actual medium viscosity (0.9–1.1e-3 Pa·s) and recalibrate flow if needed; shear scales linearly with viscosity.",
      "Confirm the syringe pump delivers 1.2 µL/min accurately at this low rate (use a low-volume glass syringe and prime the line).",
      "A549 OCR is not in the registry; the O2 check used a conservative 0.01 fmol/s/cell estimate — confirm with the actual cell density at harvest.",
